{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226340","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222634001:1":{"text":"이봐, 다들 괜찮아요?!","source_cn":"喂，你们没事吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9944A56F5822A4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222634002:1":{"text":"크, 큰일 났어. 부두목이 피를 아주 많이 흘렸어! 설마...","source_cn":"不、不好了，二当家流了好多血！他是不是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE52D2DC82182438E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222634003:1":{"text":"그런 소리 하지 마세욥! 루카 씨는 잠시 기절한 것뿐이라고요!","source_cn":"别说晦气话，卢卡只是暂时昏迷了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB4FEB7F448915AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222634004:1":{"text":"그나저나 여러분은 어쩌다 이쪽에 오신 거예요? 보니는요!","source_cn":"倒是你们两个，怎么跑到这边来了？波妮呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x202766FFE3558461","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222634005:1":{"text":"그 여자 그레이브본은 우리 형제들이 본부로 데려갔어. 생각해 보니 이쪽도 사람이 필요할 것 같아서...","source_cn":"那个女亡灵已经被弟兄们押回总部了，我们想着你们估计也需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AF68D43F7382BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222634006:0":{"text":"마침 도움이 필요하긴 했어요! 루카 씨의 상처를 건드리지 않도록 조심하세요. 어서 러스트 항으로 데려가서 치료해야 해요!","source_cn":"正好需要你们帮忙！小心点，不要扯到卢卡的伤口，快把他送...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x866852EC769F34EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222634007:0":{"text":"그리고 좀 골치 아프기는 하지만... 소니아에게 지금 상황에 대해서도 설명해 줘야 해요. ","source_cn":"另外，我们还得去找索尼娅说明现在的情况。有些棘手……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4BA81AF1B0D8953","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:血薇帮的阿柴":{"text":"아차","source":"血薇帮的阿柴","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮的阿吉":{"text":"아지","source":"血薇帮的阿吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":4}}